{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果最新推出的MacBook Pro採用了先進的OLED顯示技術，但部分購買者卻發現，長時間使用這款筆記本電腦後會出現眼睛疲勞、頭痛甚至頭暈等不適症狀。問題可能與新款顯示屏採用的脈衝寬度調製（PWM）亮度控制技術有關。對於部分對屏幕閃爍敏感的用户而言，新顯示屏的實際使用體驗甚至可能不如上一代Mini-LED機型。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585872.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.489939+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:56:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"ec9d73fccacc010771658de06aabb1a2847e770313b833c333defc4c64b1e12a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}